{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">長江生命科技上半年虧損收窄，蝕2,873萬元，低於前一年同期的1.5億元虧損。維持不派中期股息。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">期內收入則上升百分之4.2，至27.1億元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-11T23:59:54.654120+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":71,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}